# --- Append-only runtime logs (regenerable; tracked files already in repo are unaffected by these patterns, but exempt explicitly for defense) ---
data/*_log.jsonl
# expression_decision_log.jsonl is a regenerable append-only log written by every
# production run; keeping it tracked made the working tree dirty on every run and
# polluted commit_sha provenance (2026-07-15 provenance flag). Untracked here so
# `git.dirty` reflects code state only. Working copy is retained locally.
.learnings/corrections.md

